Package: accelpro-vpn
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-tk, python3-pil, python3-six, python3-xlib, openvpn, pkexec | policykit-1, libnotify-bin, xdg-utils@CLIENTDEPS@
Recommends: python3-gi, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Suggests: google-chrome-stable | chromium | chromium-browser
Description: Desktop launcher and monitor for the AccelPro VPN client
 Graphical launcher for the AccelPro Zero Trust Linux client. Opens the
 server's WebAuth page in a compact window (browser-saved password + TOTP),
 shows live tunnel statistics, uptime and internal service reachability,
 detects link loss, and provides a system-tray icon.
 .
 The password and TOTP are never stored by this application.
